\u7891\'3fng.
\par 2/ Chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn vay qua Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft nam
\par -  B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft nam tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc 5 ng\'e0y theo l\u7883\'3fch thanh to\'e1n quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0
\u7891\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15215370\charrsid4855470 \'fd gi\u7919\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af50\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
