\par + Gi\u7845\'3fy \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft nam k\'e8m theo ti\u7871\'3fn \'f0\u7897\'3f thanh to\'e1n c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f 
