\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15215370\charrsid4855470 + B\'e1o c\'e1o \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f v\u7873\'3f t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15215370\charrsid4855470 \'ecnh h\'ecnh nh\u7853
\'3fn v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng v\u7889\'3fn vay c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af50\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f50\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15215370\charrsid4855470 \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft nam theo ch\u7871
