\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f c\u7911\'3fa ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft nam.
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ch\u7911\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\u7841\'3fn cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft nam, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng \'d0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd v
